<title>UK: Cookson 96 pretax profit drops 8 pct.</title>
<headline>Cookson 96 pretax profit drops 8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		17.0		   vs 18.9</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 4.7		    vs 4.5</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 8.6		    vs 8.0</p>
<p> Pretax  profit	   166		    vs 181</p>
<p> Turnover		   1,878		  vs 1,800</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Cookson Group Plc. The company said pretax profit after exceptional items dropped to 45 million stg from 168 million a year earlier. The company said it expected to return to earnings growth this year.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
